WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.450
The Structural Conclusion.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:13.787
The blood of vulnerable citizens processed through the MAID pipeline stains both the politicians who drafted the legislation and the RCMP Commissioners who possessed armed jurisdiction to halt it.

00:00:13.787 --> 00:00:19.587
They could have crossed the floor, applied handcuffs, and stopped a modern eugenics program.

00:00:19.587 --> 00:00:21.962
They simply chose not to.
